; Generic routines: duplicate type parameters, redefinitions, generics in
; routines, missing definitions, specializing what is not a generic (or
; with another number of type arguments), and errors in a specialization's
; body, reported where the generic says it with a note at the use.
; RUN: not %pcc --mode=objfpc -ferror-limit=0 -c %S/Inputs/generics/errors.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck %s
; CHECK: errors.pas:6:25: error: duplicate type parameter 'T'
; CHECK: errors.pas:14:18: error: redefinition of generic function 'Twice'
; CHECK: errors.pas:10:9: note: previous definition is here
; CHECK: errors.pas:20:20: error: generic routines must be declared at program or unit level
; CHECK: errors.pas:18:18: error: 'Later' is declared forward but never defined
; CHECK: errors.pas:30:19: error: 'Plain' is not a generic routine with 1 type parameter
; CHECK: errors.pas:31:19: error: 'Twice' is not a generic routine with 2 type parameters
; CHECK: errors.pas:32:19: error: use of undeclared identifier 'Nope'
; CHECK: errors.pas:33:19: error: generic function 'Later' is used before its definition
; CHECK: errors.pas:18:9: note: declared here
; CHECK: errors.pas:34:25: error: unknown type name 'TNope'
; CHECK: errors.pas:4:15: error: invalid operands to '+' ('boolean' and 'integer')
; CHECK: errors.pas:29:19: note: in the specialization 'Bad<boolean>' requested here
; CHECK-NOT: error:

; RUN: not %pcc --mode=objfpc -ferror-limit=0 -c %S/Inputs/generics/parse.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=PARSE %s
; PARSE: parse.pas:2:18: error: expected '<' and type parameters after the name of generic function 'NoParams'
; PARSE: parse.pas:3:31: error: constraints on type parameters are not supported yet
; PARSE-NOT: error:
